{"server":"tw","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_04_end","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_04","title":"舊舞步","storyCode":"EA-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"e3c24046b783e975455a3b5c48a57550a2cc43686e925dbe748944dd1d17d9ac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雕像燃燒的廣場上，過去與現在的舞約重疊，愛布拉娜與拉芙希妮隔著已逝的英雄對峙。一切結束後，拉芙希妮受到託付，帶著逝者離開納斯爾紗，前往遺跡。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>高傲的紅龍沒有朋友，只會偶爾和鏡子裡的自己聊聊天。</i>\n<i>某年夏末節，她要舉辦一場盛大的宴會，需要鏡中人出來幫忙，但她們兩個不能同時出現在別人面前，否則鏡中人就會消失。</i>\n<i>鏡中人不得不遵循紅龍的命令，出發去邀請神秘的守靈人。守靈人卻無論如何也不願赴宴，還勸鏡中人不要再回去。</i>\n<i>但鏡中人仍然隻身回到紅龍的巢穴。此時宴會已經開始，鏡中人連忙躲進篝火外的黑暗。</i>\n<i>不知不覺中，來赴宴的人一個個消失，而紅龍硬是把鏡中人從黑暗中拉出來，強迫她和自己跳舞。</i>\n<i>她們跳啊跳，跳啊跳，鏡中人覺得自己的腳趾都快掉了，她想休息一下，紅龍卻無論如何也不肯停下來。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"給你，拉芙希妮。\n你要的書，蒸汽騎士冒險故事的續集。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"你問我，“為什麼”？\n這不需要理由，我親愛的妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是，你真的需要讀這個嗎？\n讀一本要不是迫於同齡人的壓力，你其實根本就不感興趣的書？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我自己想看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是對父親說過的嗎？你不想被其他人問為什麼會有維多利亞人不喜歡看蒸汽騎士的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本書……是爸爸讓你幫我買的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你……為什麼會知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在後退，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡你像其他人一樣畏懼我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你這麼害怕被我知道這些事情，不如來跟我跳一支舞，緩解一下緊張，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是……跳舞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不可以是呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"說著，愛布拉娜甚至優雅地朝妹妹伸出手。\n但在拉芙希妮的印象裡，即便在父母放起一家人都喜歡的音樂，父親搖頭晃腦，母親用手指在桌上敲著節拍的時候……\n姐姐都只是冷冷地笑著，端坐在原位。\n她從未跟著音樂舞動過身體。一次都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你能跟上我的腳步時，你就不必再為一本書、一個請求或是幾個同齡的朋友煩憂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"還沒拆封的騎士小說掉在地上，新書好聞的氣味被泥水掩沒。\n她還太小，她沒想過如願以償也能如此沉重苦澀，她只記得自己踉蹌著轉身離開，沒有握住那隻伸向自己的……\n柔軟而冰冷的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人群已經散去，不必再隱藏自己的身分了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你仍然覺得他們還活著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，每個塔拉人心中都燃燒著這樣的火。從我們的祖先向維多利亞人俯首開始，火就從未熄滅過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城裡的人如此，那些隨我回來的人們也是一樣，只是他們的火從未染上死亡的顏色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯的比喻，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我現在再來問問你吧，你要怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再去把那團火漆成你的顏色？我想你一定已經試過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是誰，一旦沾染了死亡，你的火焰就只能將其化為灰燼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，拉芙希妮，殺死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同時殺死城裡的所有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的這麼在意一件事會如何被記述，你也可以說，是我殺了他們，你只是把他們埋葬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"納斯爾紗的人們還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕驅動那具身體的已經只剩死亡，而非生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的連一點生命的火種都不存在，他們早就變成你那些遊蕩、無知無識的行屍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們早晚會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他們不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寧願將活人身上的紫火視為一場瘟疫，一場因你而起的瘟疫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你要去幫這場瘟疫尋找解藥了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望那個解藥能讓你也一併痊癒，愛布拉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真……好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，真好，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己還沒注意到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經在想如何治癒我，而不是如何逃避我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。跳那支我一直想邀你一起，你卻總是逃開的舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說，來跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在最後一個小節之前，用你的槍貫穿我的心臟。致死的瘟疫沒有解藥，你的意志足夠堅定，你的行動卻終將只是徒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，別再逃避宿命了……納斯爾紗的，還有我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夏末節還沒到，但生與死之間的界限已經比塔拉歷史上的任何時刻都要模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的想讓塔拉變成死的國度嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉芙希妮下意識地轉過頭去。\n熾烈的紫火仍在英雄一路拖行至此的骨架上熊熊燃燒，而剛剛被紫火佔據、猛地站起的庫林的身體，此刻也跪倒在地。\n她不忍再看，於是回過頭，直視姐姐的雙眼，和那隻時隔多年重新伸向自己的手。\n不知是錯覺，還是紫火籠罩下的一切都會失去生機，相比記憶之中，她眼前那隻手蒼白得毫無血色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是一座城市，這是無數人的生命。愛布拉娜，這不是能用宿命兩個字輕飄飄地概括的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說完了嗎？我覺得我們已經在各自的頻道講得夠久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……愛布拉娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你大可以繼續長篇大論下去，反正只要你想，我就會站在這裡等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是快點，拉芙希妮。你終究是等得起的，其他人卻未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）你說得對，你終究是等得起的，但其他人卻未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，這場舞我陪你跳，直到我們之中有一個倒地不起為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我不會按你的舞步來。絕不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"悉聽尊便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是有一件事你會錯意了，親愛的拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個等不起的人，此刻就站在你面前呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"等不起？\n拉芙希妮緊緊盯著姐姐的臉龐，她突然意識到一件徹頭徹尾離題的事情。\n那隻手的蒼白並非錯覺。\n紫火幾乎編織成一張鋪天蓋地的披風，讓愛布拉娜顯得美麗而可怖，卻也無法掩飾她皮膚裡透出的，如同消耗性的惡疾作祟一樣的慘白。\n她不該是這樣的，她從沒像這樣過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛布拉娜，你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你……還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"愛布拉娜臉上泛起笑意。她的笑總掛在她的臉上，冷冰冰的。\n此刻的笑容彷彿有了些許溫度，卻更顯得慘白的臉怵目驚心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝關心，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這些冷漠的別離與苦楚的團聚之後，能聽見你的問候，也真的是……久違了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便，我倒也確實想和你跳一場舞，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等我找到治好你的方法，我會和你跳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我會在這裡等著的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"愛布拉娜信步走向堡壘，那腳步聲飄渺到虛弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……紅龍！涅梅絲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我到城門的時候，那裡一個人都沒有！我知道一定是出了什麼事，廣場上到底——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅龍，這……是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉芙希妮懷中抱著一個小小的匣子。在夜間昏暗的燈光下，似乎什麼都比平日更加模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我救不了庫林，只能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只能以這種方式讓他得以安息，不必繼續在廣場上受死火的煎熬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遊牧人沉默了半晌，在地上摸索到一枚石頭。\n她用盡渾身的力氣，將那枚石頭狠狠砸向堡壘的方向。\n但那石頭旋即被夜裡的黑暗吞沒，甚至沒有發出一絲聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宵禁已經開始了。涅梅絲、布莉吉，我們先——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"涅梅絲伸手從木匣上方虛虛拂過，似乎試圖擦去一些不存在的灰塵。\n她忽然想起幾天前，自己被原本的同族拒絕時，那人對自己說的一些多餘的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g5_remains_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守靈人不和生者團結，也不需要生者的尊重，除非他們已經死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是深池理當尊重的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，多謝您還願意給我這枚哨笛……我回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，涅梅絲。你明知道夏末節將至，守靈人不太可能拿得出什麼祭器，但你還是來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些深池強迫你來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我自己——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲，你的個性還真是一點都沒變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待、斡旋、調和……你在納斯爾紗，在那條紅龍的麾下，也執著於這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是……不希望看到本該向好的情況惡化，本該同心協力的人起衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如衝突本就無法避免，你只會在其中越陷越深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市將你浸染得黯淡了，涅梅絲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以領袖——紅龍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，愛布拉娜是不會為納斯爾紗帶來真正的生活的，對嗎，拉芙希妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說她做不到。她……其實並不喜歡說謊，除非另有制約……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經是整個塔拉的領袖，獨一無二的紅龍，還有什麼能制約她？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲，你怎麼了？你看起來……不對勁……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。拉芙希妮殿下，我突然明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來那道火的確會侵染活人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經依賴的人們，原來是一群中飽私囊的蛀蟲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經信仰的領袖，原來是一條目無他人生死的惡龍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經不惜性命捍衛的人們……我的摯友為他們而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，如果不是那條惡龍用紫火將他點燃，我都不知道他們還會對他做些什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林問得對，等到夏末節過去，我該做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了復仇，我沒有什麼能做的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這句話說出口之後，拉芙希妮看見，最後一名還未沾染紫火的納斯爾紗居民，她身上燃起了火焰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉芙希妮殿下，您會因此將我當成城裡人的同類，愛布拉娜的僕臣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是這致死的惡疾……終於傳染到了最後一個城裡人身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，拉芙希妮殿下，我發誓，我會協助您把這支強加於您的舞一直跳下去，一直跳下去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到那條邪惡的紅龍倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我聽見了你的誓言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我得離開納斯爾紗一趟。跟我一起走吧，涅梅絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守靈人的聚落，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。城裡已經沒有治癒那道火焰的希望，我得去找到任何可能幫得上忙的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不會去。我已經沒有資格回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會在城市裡待下去。只要沒被紅龍注意到，沒被她撕成碎片……我會努力不讓事態繼續惡化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這枚哨笛，就麻煩您還回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……庫林也拜託您了。請您給庫林一個真正的葬禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葬禮上需要親友念誦悼詞，我……我寫一份，您幫我唸，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，給您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪葦草一起離開。黑林現在不放任何人出入，我們兩個人，或許會順利一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，布莉吉，你得留下，我需要你的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一個人沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也可以，但……涅梅絲，你越來越不像你自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也許這就是復仇會把人變成的樣子吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
